@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Flujo de Datos: Philips Efficia CM → OpenICE → Supervisor

actor "Philips Efficia\nCM Series\n(Hardware LAN)" as Efficia

box "OpenICE (Headless / PC)" #f5f5f5
participant "Hl7Service\n(HAPI SimpleServer)" as Hl7
participant "Efficia\n(AbstractConnectedDevice)" as Driver
participant "EfficiaHL7Parser\n(Parsing ORU)" as Parser
participant "DDS DataWriter\n(Publisher)" as Writer
participant "TimescalePersister\n(Persistence)" as DB
end box

box "Supervisor (PC / GUI)" #e8f4f8
participant "DDS DataReader\n(Subscriber)" as Reader
participant "DeviceListModel /\nNumericModel" as Model
participant "UI Components\n(JavaFX)" as UI
end box

== 1. Conexión del Efficia al servidor MLLP ==

Efficia -> Hl7: TCP连接 (MLLP client → server)\nPuerto 4202
activate Hl7
Hl7 -> Driver: ConnectionState → Connecting
Hl7 -> Hl7: Espera primer mensaje HL7
deactivate Hl7

== 2. Recepción y parseo de datos ORU ==

Efficia -> Hl7: ORU^R01 (HL7 v2.4, MLLP framed)\nMSH + PID + PV1 + ORC + OBR + OBX
activate Hl7
Hl7 -> Driver: ConnectionState → Connected
Hl7 -> Parser: castToORU(msg) + parse(oru)
activate Parser

Parser -> Parser: Navegar PATIENT_RESULT\n→ ORDER_OBSERVATION\n→ OBSERVATION[]
Parser -> Parser: Mapear MDIL codes:\n0002-4182→HR, 0002-4bb8→SpO2,\n0002-5000→Resp, 0002-480a→Pulse
Parser -> Parser: Determinar ObservationStatus:\nF=Final, X=Disconnected
Parser -> Parser: Verificar OBR-4:\nMONITOR (datos) vs ALARM (alerta)

Parser -> Driver: EfficiaData\n(heartRate, spo2, respRate, pulse, ...)
deactivate Parser

== 3. Publicación a DDS ==

activate Driver
Driver -> Driver: numericSample(heartRate, value, timestamp)\nnumericSample(spo2, value, timestamp)\nnumericSample(respRate, value, timestamp)\nnumericSample(pulse, value, timestamp)
Driver -> Writer: write(Numeric, InstanceHandle_t)\n[Tópico DDS: "ice::Numeric"]
deactivate Driver
deactivate Hl7

== 4. Persistencia ==

Writer -> DB: Multicast/Unicast UDP (RTPS)\n[Topic: ice::Numeric]
activate DB
DB -> DB: INSERT INTO vital_values\n(unique_device_identifier, metric_id,\n value, unit, timestamp)
deactivate DB

== 5. ACK al Efficia ==

Hl7 -> Efficia: ACK (MSA|AA|messageControlId)\nMLLP framed
note right: El Efficia confirma recepción.\nReintenta 3 veces si no recibe ACK.

== 6. Consulta en el Supervisor ==

Reader -> Model: on_data_available()\n(Evento RTI DDS)
activate Reader
deactivate Reader

activate Model
Model -> Model: Verificar UDI del dispositivo\nExtraer metric_id, value, timestamp
Model -> UI: Platform.runLater(() →\n  actualizarGráfico(data))
deactivate Model

activate UI
UI -> UI: Actualizar panel numérico:\n  HR: 72 bpm\n  SpO2: 98 %\n  Resp: 14 rpm\n  Pulse: 71 bpm
deactivate UI

== 7. Manejo de Alarmas (OBR-4 = ALARM) ==

Efficia -> Hl7: ORU^R01 con OBX tipo TX\nMDIL-ALERT: "Yellow Alarm"
activate Hl7
Hl7 -> Parser: parse(oru)
Parser -> Driver: EfficiaData\n(alarmType=YELLOW_ALARM,\n alarmText="SpO₂ baja, SpO₂ = 80%")
Driver -> Writer: writePatientAlert(key, text)\n[Tópico: ice::PatientAlert]
deactivate Hl7

Writer -> Reader: RTPS multicast
activate Reader
Reader -> Model: on_data_available()\n(Topic: ice::PatientAlert)
Model -> UI: Mostrar alarma en UI\n(icono amarillo + texto)
deactivate Reader

== 8. Desconexión del paciente (OBX status = X) ==

Efficia -> Hl7: ORU^R01 con OBX status X\n(valores vacíos)
activate Hl7
Hl7 -> Parser: parse(oru)
Parser -> Driver: EfficiaData\n(status=DISCONNECTED)
note over Driver: No publica valores.\nLos valores se mantienen en\núltimo estado conocido.
deactivate Hl7

@enduml
